{"id":"5d95d0f3f7f2d870","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-regularcovercandidates.md","title":"Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list","display":"thm-regularcovercandidates — Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-regularcovercandidates","aliases":["27-thm-regularcovercandidates"],"display":"thm-regularcovercandidates — Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list","depends_on":["[[27-thm-regulardualboundary]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.6 Theorems 8.30–8.31","source_statement":"Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list","source_printed_pages":"377–378","source_pdf_pages":"401–402","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-regularcovercandidates"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-regularcovercandidates</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regularcovercandidates — Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f42749f172754927\" href=\"?note=f42749f172754927\" title=\"27-thm-regulardualboundary\">27-thm-regulardualboundary</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Theorems 8.30–8.31"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d95d0f3f7f2d870\" href=\"?note=5d95d0f3f7f2d870\" title=\"Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list\">Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"377–378"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"401–402"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f((0)_{k\\in[n]})=0\">\\(f((0)_{k\\in[n]})=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=1)\">\\(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span> 及候选构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_f,X^{i,j}\">\\(J_f,X^{i,j}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f42749f172754927\" href=\"?note=f42749f172754927\" title=\"27-thm-regulardualboundary\">27-thm-regulardualboundary</a> 及其定义依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=|\\mathcal M(f)|\">\\(m=|\\mathcal M(f)|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^1,\\ldots,Y^m\">\\(Y^1,\\ldots,Y^m\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\chi_A\\mid A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\}\">\\(\\{\\chi_A\\mid A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\}\\)</span> 的无重复枚举，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r,s\\in[m]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(Y^r_k&lt;Y^s_k\\land\\forall t\\in[n]\\;(t&lt;k\\Rightarrow Y^r_t=Y^s_t)))\">\\(\\forall r,s\\in[m]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(Y^r_k&lt;Y^s_k\\land\\forall t\\in[n]\\;(t&lt;k\\Rightarrow Y^r_t=Y^s_t)))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\">\\(c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k=\\max_{(i,j)\\in J_f}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k=\\max_{(i,j)\\in J_f}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\underset{(i,j)\\in J_f}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right)\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in J_f:X^{i,j}\\in\\underset{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\underset{(i,j)\\in J_f}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right)\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in J_f:X^{i,j}\\in\\underset{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非负成本使每个假点都可扩充到不低目标值的极大假点，再代入候选坐标即可。f(0)=0 与至少一个真点一起排除两常函数，使两个最大值的候选域均非空。用前缀和与后缀和能在常数次算术中评价每个候选，但此处仅断言最优值及解对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-thm-regulardualboundary","status":"resolved","id":"f42749f172754927","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-regulardualboundary]]","embed":false},{"target":"Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list","status":"resolved","id":"5d95d0f3f7f2d870","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-regulardualboundary","status":"resolved","id":"f42749f172754927","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$，$f((0)_{k\\in[n]})=0$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=1)$；$\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$、$\\chi_A$、$\\mathcal M(f)$ 及候选构造 $J_f,X^{i,j}$ 见 [[27-thm-regulardualboundary]] 及其定义依赖。$m=|\\mathcal M(f)|$，$Y^1,\\ldots,Y^m$ 为 $\\{\\chi_A\\mid A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\}$ 的无重复枚举，且 $\\forall r,s\\in[m]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(Y^r_k<Y^s_k\\land\\forall t\\in[n]\\;(t<k\\Rightarrow Y^r_t=Y^s_t)))$。$c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f((0)_{k\\in[n]})=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M(f)","display":false},{"tex":"J_f,X^{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"m=|\\mathcal M(f)|","display":false},{"tex":"Y^1,\\ldots,Y^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\chi_A\\mid A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r,s\\in[m]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(Y^r_k<Y^s_k\\land\\forall t\\in[n]\\;(t<k\\Rightarrow Y^r_t=Y^s_t)))","display":false},{"tex":"c=(c_1,\\ldots,c_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k=\\max_{(i,j)\\in J_f}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\underset{(i,j)\\in J_f}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{j-1}c_kY^i_k+\\sum_{k=j+1}^{n}c_k\\right)\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in J_f:X^{i,j}\\in\\underset{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ f(x)=0}{\\operatorname{argmax}}\\sum_{k=1}^nc_kx_k\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2195,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-regularcovercandidates|thm-regularcovercandidates — Regular set covering optimization over an implicit candidate list]]"}],"outgoing":["f42749f172754927"]}